<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#A2.SS4" title="In Appendix B Proof ‣ Efficient Generalization via Multimodal Co-Training under Data Scarcity and Distribution Shift" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">B.4 </span>Proof of Theorem <span class="ltx_ref"></span></span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#A2.SS5" title="In Appendix B Proof ‣ Efficient Generalization via Multimodal Co-Training under Data Scarcity and Distribution Shift" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">B.5 </span>Proof of Corollary <span class="ltx_ref"></span></span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#A2.SS6" title="In Appendix B Proof ‣ Efficient Generalization via Multimodal Co-Training under Data Scarcity and Distribution Shift" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">B.6 </span>Proof of Corollary <span class="ltx_ref"></span></span></a></li>
</ol></li>
