<td id="S3.T1.2.2.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_t" style="--ltx-bg-color:#F8FAFD;">
<span id="S3.T1.2.2.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top">
<span id="S3.T1.2.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_left"><span id="S3.T1.2.2.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-bg-color:#F8FAFD;">This Work (Theorem <a href="#S3.Thmtheorem7" title="Theorem 3.7 (Generalization Bound) ‣ 3.3 Generalization Bound for Multimodal Co-Training ‣ 3 Main Results ‣ Efficient Generalization via Multimodal Co-Training under Data Scarcity and Distribution Shift" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">3.7</span></a>)</span></span>
</span></td>
<td id="S3.T1.2.2.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_t" style="--ltx-bg-color:#F8FAFD;">
<span id="S3.T1.2.2.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top">
<span id="S3.T1.2.2.2.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_left"><span id="S3.T1.2.2.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-bg-color:#F8FAFD;">Yes (<math id="S3.T1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\Gamma" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi style="--ltx-bg-color:#F8FAFD;" mathbackground="#F8FAFD" mathvariant="normal">Γ</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\Gamma</annotation></semantics></math> term, subtractive)</span></span>
</span></td>
<td id="S3.T1.2.2.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_t" style="--ltx-bg-color:#F8FAFD;">
<span id="S3.T1.2.2.3.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top">
<span id="S3.T1.2.2.3.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_left"><span id="S3.T1.2.2.3.1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-bg-color:#F8FAFD;">Yes (explicit in <math id="S3.T1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\Gamma" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi style="--ltx-bg-color:#F8FAFD;" mathbackground="#F8FAFD" mathvariant="normal">Γ</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\Gamma</annotation></semantics></math>)</span></span>
</span></td>
<td id="S3.T1.2.2.4" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_t" style="--ltx-bg-color:#F8FAFD;">
<span id="S3.T1.2.2.4.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top">
<span id="S3.T1.2.2.4.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_left"><span id="S3.T1.2.2.4.1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-bg-color:#F8FAFD;">Yes (explicit in <math id="S3.T1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\Gamma" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi style="--ltx-bg-color:#F8FAFD;" mathbackground="#F8FAFD" mathvariant="normal">Γ</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\Gamma</annotation></semantics></math>, and as our assumptions)</span></span>
</span></td>
<td id="S3.T1.2.2.5" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_t" style="--ltx-bg-color:#F8FAFD;">
