<span id="S3.T1.2.3.3.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_left"><span id="S3.T1.2.3.3.1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-bg-color:#F8FAFD;">Yes (via disagreement rate)</span></span>
</span></td>
